<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa to privatise 100 pct of PX transport firm.</title>
<headline>S.Africa to privatise 100 pct of PX transport firm.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African government aimed to privatise 100 percent of loss-making consignment distribution business PX, Transport Minister Mac Maharaj said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;PX has also been put on the table with labour with government saying it is its intention to wholly privatise it as with Autonet,&quot; he told Reuters after a news briefing.</p>
<p>He added the government was reviewing the future of ports operator Portnet with unions.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
